aiopyinfrahub
Copyright 2026 Cody Halley

This work is an independent async client for the Infrahub GraphQL and REST
APIs. It follows the public API shape conventions of the pynetbox/pynautobot
client lineage where compatible with asyncio, and is informed by the official
infrahub-sdk (Apache 2.0, OpsMill).

No code from infrahub-sdk, pynautobot, or pynetbox is vendored here. Any
future vendored code must retain its original copyright notice and Apache
License 2.0 header.
